<title>POLAND: TENNIS-POLAND LEADS GHANA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-POLAND LEADS GHANA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>POZNAN, Poland 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland led Ghana 2-0 in</p>
<p>their Davis Cup tennis Euro/African zone group two first round</p>
<p>tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Results (Polish names first):</p>
<p>Bartlomiej Dabrowski beat Daniel Omaboe 6-0 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Filip Aniola beat Franko Ofori 6-1 6-3 6-0</p>
</text>
